    <ul class="footer-links">
      <li><a href="/">Free Guide</a></li>
      <li><a href="/about.html">About</a></li>
      <li><a href="/services.html">Work With Me</a></li>
    </ul>
    <p class="footer-copy">© 2026 Autism Pathways Consulting · Kuala Lumpur, Malaysia</p>
  </div>
